  // tagline text — SSL's is the only page exercising this prop so far.
  // `right-[13%]` is the same inset the domains page's hand-rolled hero
  // uses for its own tagline-vs-globe pairing at a similar image size;
  // it leaves the tagline its own clear strip at the edge.
